<title>BELGIUM: Belgian August budget deficit widens.</title>
<headline>Belgian August budget deficit widens.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian federal state's budget deficit widened in August to 27.4 billion francs from 10.4 billion in August 1995, the finance and budget ministries said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The cumulative borrowing requirement for the first eight months of 1996 narrowed to 317.1 billion francs from 343.2 billion in the same period last year.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
